Zstandard (zstd) single-file amalgamation
==========================================

Version : 1.5.7
Author  : Yann Collet / Meta Platforms, Inc.
License : BSD 2-Clause (see LICENSE)
Source  : https://github.com/facebook/zstd/releases/tag/v1.5.7

Files
-----
  zstd.c   -- single-file amalgamation (generated by
              build/single_file_libs/create_single_file_library.sh)
  zstd.h   -- public API header
  LICENSE  -- BSD 2-Clause license

C Standard Note
---------------
This library is C99.  It is explicitly exempt from BoltPack's C89/ANSI
portability rule (see docs/portability.md).  It is compiled separately
with -std=c99 and linked into modern 32/64-bit targets only.
src/core/zstd_wrap.c wraps the API behind a C89-compatible interface.
